+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project
+
+`shop-api`: a TypeScript API service. The repo is at an early stage. Right now it holds only `package.json`, `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `src/money.ts`. The `dev` script's entry point (`src/index.ts`) doesn't exist yet. `package.json` doesn't declare any dependencies either, so `tsx`, `vitest` and `eslint` must be added before the scripts below will run.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `npm run dev`: run the server with file watching (`tsx watch src/index.ts`)
+- `npm test`: run the test suite once (`vitest run`)
+- `npm test -- path/to/file.test.ts`: run a single test file. Add `-t "test name"` to filter by test name.
+- `npm run lint`: run ESLint over the repo
+
+Run `npm test` before pushing. CI runs lint too, so run `npm run lint` as well.
+
+## Rules (from CONTRIBUTING.md)
+
+- **Money is always integer cents.** Use the `Cents` type from `src/money.ts` for every monetary value. Never use floats for money, including for intermediate calculations.
+- **Never edit a migration that has shipped.** To change the schema, add a new migration.
+- **`legacy/` is frozen.** Change it only for security fixes. (The folder doesn't exist yet, but the rule applies once it does.)
